This pull request extends the testing capabilities by automatically booting the application when requiring some resource from app container.

ex:
```php
test('my test`, function () {
    // Add a test provider
    app()->provider(MyProvider::class);

    /**
     * Get an implementation from container.
     * Before this PR it throws an error if we do not manually boot the app before.
     */
    $myClass = app()->get(MyInterface::class);

    // continue testing...
});
```

